  <item>
    <title>22 牛来的叙事说明审美是不断变化的正态分布</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a902ec2ef65145dfcc664dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a902ec2ef65145dfcc664dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:37:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没有炫技但又满是心血，这就是一个关于普通人的故事。审美是主观的，也是从众的。金子说，在这个不大好看的画面里，牛来的眼神像自家小狗一样。恰恰是留白，激起铺天盖地的涟漪。</span></p><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 为什么去院线看这部动画结果还睡着了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 就云雀和牛来讨论一下对镜像关系的理解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 蛇的变扭是作者的不迎合也辅助角色塑造</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 豹子对“非我族类其心必诛”的反叛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> 意识到死亡可以是一种选择也就不在于悲壮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> 淡淡的节奏感，普通人的情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">45:03</a> 对现代工业的反应不一定是恐惧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 醒来是梦还是要解释生命的终结</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3004">50:04</a> 鲁迅先生看到大概会欣慰吧</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期配乐</span></p><p><span>蓝莲花-许巍</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f7c36a101d6b5816c9cd47/lgKtfZhIW0U2lfXSzDqQKlkm1elE.m4a" length="53544491" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGU16_FnM6ONThWbBZ0iPAQR9cc.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>21 语言学习让人看清斩杀线梗的文字游戏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6966f24c109824f9e15eebd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6966f24c109824f9e15eebd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 01:48:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们想讨论为什么教育是轻奢，而语言学习又如何影响了我们的思维。从近期官媒到各种梗图，实际原文并非意在斩杀线，而是提出Broken Benchmark来重新定义美国21世纪贫困线。语言是工具，也反作用于其使用者。我们对语言的应用是终身的，同时对语言的学习其实也从来没停过。语言的模糊性和准确度都是社会化的成果。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 教育成了普通家庭的最大支出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 数学的前置课程是语文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 思考的过程让人不得已在脑子里念一遍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 文字和发音能不能统一看需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> 汉语的简洁教我们用两种不同的思考方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> 读书是艺术是门槛是社会筛选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 慢思考是机器语言快思考是人类本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 中英夹杂是快思考和精准的结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">46:18</a> 大语言模型的训练是拟合人脑的函数</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：谁知爱是什么-方大同</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f7c36a101d6b5816c9cd47/lmX8Jsu_L9JIKT0Ipj1aeusThJYe.m4a" length="37571871" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPXzw7QZmoYAO6kdoPE3TFEWp3d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>20 土生万物由来远，地载群伦自古尊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe1e6d083a71a4eb51890b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fe1e6d083a71a4eb51890b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 13:25:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>缱绻和决绝即是庄户人与土地羁绊的变化，也是个体之间的难舍难分。时代巨变让我们看到的群像生存故事，遥远又咫尺。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">0:06</a> 区别达到目的就是好改编</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1.主角性别导向</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.篇幅摘选和留白</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.时代背景是个体利己的工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 人口决定土地的生产模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 费左氏拿的才是大女主剧本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 不愿卖地赎人的原因得追述到宁氏发家史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2727">45:27</a> 能掌握自己命运的就是主角</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>一荤一素（伴奏）- 毛不易</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f7c36a101d6b5816c9cd47/lvJXGFRA15ABLnE1Hl-ntSJkunTF.m4a" length="39076420" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhdUCxH4AeoHRg88y7TrRKNzG2D.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
