    <guid isPermaLink="false">680477bf1f1db84a5663b2a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 04:41:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>发生在富士山下的“日常”，重新定义超能力和英雄主义，那是渴望改变的日本啊。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgpeSiDQQGOI92p8fuiRUQYd9rXV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 反一切超英套路的半宇宙人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 混血是为了延续，融合是为了生存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 没有“新闻”的日常，老龄化社会的冷清</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a> 打破世界对日本的刻板印象，打破由礼貌造成的距离感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 血脉里蕴含的热血，正在被唤醒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7tpnJaA_gsTZjjYq4UlcM-5k9U.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场：晚安，地球人 - 五月天 （神的孩子都在跳舞）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM&amp;片尾：Dear sunrise - 大槻マキ（ TV动画《ONE PIECE海贼王》未来岛篇片尾曲）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLSuIq6bohSsleGhkoxwsnwLpMi.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f7c36a101d6b5816c9cd47/lus3XjO3k0mBKHYLY8EaMprg4oU2.m4a" length="44725288" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:22</itunes:duration>
